  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1304.08 Disbursements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1304.08 Disbursements.\n\n(a) The department shall approve a request submitted as specified in Env-Dw 1304.07 if it determines that:\n\n(1) The costs covered by the request are eligible costs covered by the recipient’s financial assistance agreement; and\n\n(2) The costs have not been covered by any previous disbursement.\n\n(b) Upon approval of the request, the department shall authorize the disbursement to be made from the DWGTF, subject to Env-Dw 1304.09.\n\n(c) The recipient shall not make disbursement requests more frequently than once per calendar month per loan or grant.\n\nSource. #12903, eff 10-23-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1300.html"
